WEBVTT

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:34.300
Six...

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.670
Seven...

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.140
Eight...

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:37.940
Nine...

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.300
Ten!

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.680
I'm coming! Yeah!

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.980
Himawari, Azami, Momota and Yusura.

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.900
I've found you!

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.600
What if you had hit us?

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.420
Really, you are as rude as a crocodile!

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.230
What are you thinking, using a machine gun in can-kicking?

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:09.160
I always fight with real swords.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.750
You've done it!

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.310
With these I can survive for two days.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.580
It's my loss again...

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:46.310
Himeji's weakness is that she can't protect anything...

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:49.560
All offense and no defense.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.510
Defense sounds lame.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:57.030
If you can't protect the important can, it's useless no matter how many times you charge.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:00.020
Real combat is different from can-kicking!

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:05.270
I will keep on charging and charging even from now on!

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:09.900
Real combat...

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.390
It's totally wrong...

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.130
Wrong?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:36.380
Look, Himeji was raised in a foreign country, right?

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:41.270
Although she longed to be a ninja since she was small...

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:43.850
She got it all wrong.

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:47.240
Although she thought that all Japanese were ninjas,

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.840
a complete focus on offense...

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.930
Everything she does is too flashy...

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.840
For a ninja, eh?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.080
If she had an important thing,

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.030
then she would understand the importance of protecting something.

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:02.820
For example,

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:03.860
Hayato?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.860
For example... him.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:12.620
It's ridiculous to protect others.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.970
It's ludicrous.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.930
Ninjas are combat experts.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.680
What a pointless thing to do, and a waste of talent.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:22.480
I don't get it!

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.590
I want to...

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.740
...become strong.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.700
I want to...

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.490
...become strong.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:35.730
That wish, I will grant it.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:45.400
I feel sleepy all of a sudden.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.860
I want to be granted my wish.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:23.130
She's late.

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:26.640
She even said she wanted to play can-kicking on this early morning.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:31.350
She said those words last night, even Himeji is shy to show her face today.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.810
This...

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.020
This is Himeji's katana.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.120
Sorry to wake you up from your sleep.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.430
Were you here last night too?

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.230
Did you see anything?

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:58.380
Do you know where Himeji went?

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.040
Ouch...

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.930
I couldn't sleep due to the pain from yesterday's wound.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:16.340
Well, since I woke up early today, I might as well pick fresh things.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.400
Since there's still a lot of time before the lesson starts.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.850
Today's dishes will be sautéed mountain udo and zenmai.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.850
Note: udo = Japanese Spikenard, zenmai = Japanese Royal Fern

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.520
Really...

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.440
What are they up to?

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:37.850
They know more about mountain food...

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:39.780
...don't they?

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.080
Hey!

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.890
You girls!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.700
We couldn't find her.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.070
Himeji-san, where are you?

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.450
She wasn't on the path to this place...

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:07.080
The owl definitely said that Himeji was taken to Mt. Hourai, right?

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.490
Even Momota's nose couldn't sense anything.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.500
The opponent is quite an expert.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.190
What?

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:25.790
Himeji-san.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.860
Wait.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.180
Nanafushi!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.270
Don't move her about.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:38.030
Why not?

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:40.100
What... What's this?

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.930
She has lost her consciousness.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:44.240
The Micro Ninja is infiltrating her now.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.480
M-Micro?

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.660
This isn't science fiction.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:52.880
They're extremely small-sized humans, those Micro Ninjas.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:53.480
Look.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.230
How dare you make Himeji-san...

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.110
It's useless.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.900
That's so-called cast-off skin.

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:19.250
They cut off their consciousness with their flesh,

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:23.050
and that consciousness is intruding Himeji's consciousness.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:27.820
Just defeating their bodies can't save Himeji.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.590
What are these?

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.870
Could it be...

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:35.990
According to my information,

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.920
rather, as all of you have seen, that stretchy boy,

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:41.380
that grassy one,

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.480
and the weird ninja that transforms into a flying squirrel, are their comrades?

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:50.190
That organization uses ninja with another special ability, and targeting Himeji now.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.670
We still don't know who their primary target is.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.620
If we capture these Micro Ninjas, we might get hold of something...

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.710
What are they going to do to Himeji?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:04.720
Infiltrating her consciousness, they might be trying to control her as they wish.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.220
Control her... as they wish?

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:11.080
If we move her wrongly,

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.760
we might stir up uneasiness in the Micro Ninjas,

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.650
and in turn hurt Himeji's mind.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.750
What should we do?

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:22.700
There is only one way.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.660
I shouldn't have gone after them...

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.240
What's this?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.950
Smells delicious...

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.090
Hey... Really?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.140
That's a lie, isn't it?

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.780
This doesn't make sense...

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:09.940
Humans who are tied to common sense are boring.

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:12.420
You should accept the situation already.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.360
Are we really inside Himeji's body?

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.930
To be precise, we are in the consciousness of Himeji.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.380
It means that we are inside her mind.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.340
I'm counting on you.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.630
There is no time.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:47.980
Huh? The plaster's gone from my forehead.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:51.770
Does this mean that I am me yet I am not me...?

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:53.690
I don't get it!

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.280
According to my information,

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:58.480
rather, I heard it from Nanafushi,

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:01.680
we can only be in Himeji's consciousness for...

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.700
Let's see...

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.110
Another 15 minutes.

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:10.020
That's the limit for spirits to be away from body.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:13.410
We must accomplish this mission before that.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:15.950
What will happen if we can't manage to do that in time?

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.960
We won't be able to return to our own body.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:20.960
In other words...?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.950
Our body will lose its consciousness.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:26.470
In other words...?

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:29.700
It means that our life will end here.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.260
N-No!

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:33.680
I-I don't want that!

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.590
It's all right, Hayato-dono.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:38.140
We will accomplish the mission before that.

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.270
What?

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.570
What should I do?

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:45.530
Find Micro Ninjas, and fight to ward them off Himeji's body.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.910
Fight?

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:47.820
Real combat.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:48.930
That's right.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.040
This is different from can-kicking.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:56.070
If we go wrong even for a single step, we're not just unable to save Himeji, we can't even get out of here.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:59.100
That means no mistake is allowed.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.150
I...

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:06.900
I want to become strong.

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.120
It's Himeji-san's voice.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.710
This way.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.700
This is...

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:38.010
Himeji-san when she was small.

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:41.240
Himeji is recollecting her memories?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.100
Memories of her past?

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:48.890
What's that?

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:51.520
Himeji's masters.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:54.370
Himeji-san's foster parents?

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:06.490
I...

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:11.620
will become stronger, so that I can live, even without protection.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.880
I will become stronger.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.220
<i>Tears?</i>

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:39.930
This is real combat, different from can-kicking like Himeji-san said, isn't it?

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.210
That's why Himeji...

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.290
Tsukiyohime-san!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:49.960
How did you enter?

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.940
It's a secret.

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:53.810
Since you appeared,

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.450
there is something that you want to say, right?

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:01.950
You shouldn't wear shoes inside other people's hearts.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.290
Well, that's true.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.540
Hey, slip out of your shoes!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.000
That's not the point.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.500
What the-

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.130
We are here to save Himeji-san.

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:13.190
Did Himeji wish for that?

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:14.830
Of course!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.760
Right?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.810
I will become strong, without protection from others!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.120
Shit!

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:29.720
How did you come here?

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.320
So you have appeared, Micro Ninja!

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.680
They are same size as us.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.720
We are being micro-sized.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.550
Get out of here at once!

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:41.220
We don't have time for you!

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.940
Film rolls...?

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:47.000
What's that?

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.350
The "Fear" film roll will be ready in just a bit.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:53.400
"The Joy of Living" finishes here.

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.000
Good.

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:55.800
What's that?

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:57.130
Isn't it great?

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.240
What?

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:01.010
We are creating a human weapon.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:03.380
Human weapon?

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.600
A human's actions are controlled by his memories.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:11.970
If a person is subjected to painful memories, he will act carefully.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:16.360
If he's subjected to happy memories, he will act optimistically.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.230
Then?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.920
This Himeji person is an extremely offensive human.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.100
Her combat ability is excellent.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.700
What are you planning to do?

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:33.410
Later I will erase that faintly remaining "Fear," and "The Joy of Living" as well.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:37.210
Then she will reborn as a never-seen before human-weapon that knows no death.

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.720
You can't possibly do that, can you?

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.230
How about this?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:42.960
Yes, this.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:47.820
This memory carved by her fear has disappeared right this instant.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.710
The modification of humans...

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:56.720
Now, with that solar power from the sun of the hell in this body,

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.580
I will erase each and every piece of her memories.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.340
I have to end this before the sun starts setting after noon.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:08.500
That's why you took the trouble to bring her onto this mountain, the nearest point to the sun?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.980
What a terrible thing to do.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.740
Stop invading other's minds!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.580
That's it! Like we're going to let you do that!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.090
I should have said this before...

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:19.180
I don't have time for you.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:22.310
There are still a lot of memories of her comrades left.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.220
Take care of them faster!

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:24.830
Yes, sir!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.330
We have no more than three minutes!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.340
Go home at once!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.570
Himeji-san!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.530
I am going to...

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:38.420
...discard all.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.360
My wish is to become strong.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.610
If I am able to become stronger with my memories erased,

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.080
that's what I want!

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:48.950
What are you saying?

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:53.680
What if you become a human weapon, or a designed weapon?!

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:55.370
That's not your problem.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:58.170
You will be made into a disposable tool.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.780
I don't want to see anyone being hurt because of me anymore!

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:06.900
Those people were satisfied for being able to protect you!

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:10.050
They took your life more seriously than their own!

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:11.470
I don't want that!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.870
That burdened me!

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:21.170
It's better for me to die then.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:24.480
I am tired of being protected!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:25.860
Look!

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:28.050
She said so herself.

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:31.040
Erase those unwanted memories at once!

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:33.000
We have got your consent!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.310
That's us...

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.580
Himeji's...

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.290
...important memories!

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:35.090
No! We will protect Himeji-san's mind!

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.320
Give them back!

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:41.280
Return them!

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.560
The same here!

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.620
Never!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.300
Stinks...

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.050
Take those remaining to another place!

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:53.170
I won't let you do that!

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.840
Look at my skill sharpened during my part-time job when I was a teenager!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.510
Thank you!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.350
Thanks!

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.350
That's enough!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.160
You bitches...

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:13.880
Ultimate Recombine!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.340
The Ultimate!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.450
What will you do? Die here?

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:31.310
You can still run now...

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.480
Let's go!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.150
Two more minutes.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.490
We'll live!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:37.460
Don't run!

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:40.880
That's enough!

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:45.250
Everyone, leave my mind at once!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.000
We won't!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:50.510
We will protect your mind to the very end.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.030
He's coming!

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.640
No good. Only one minute left!

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:09.670
Hold on!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.670
Everyone back off!

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.870
I have found the one in my way!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.980
Now. Hurry on!

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:27.020
Yes!

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:28.570
30 seconds left!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.950
Fifteen...

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.050
Fourteen...

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:35.270
Thirteen...

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:36.080
Twelve...

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.380
Eleven...

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.280
Ten...

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.190
Nine...

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.100
Eight...

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:40.990
Seven...

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:41.590
Six...

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:42.880
Five...

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:43.320
Four...

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:44.660
Three!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:45.510
Two!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:45.820
One!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.510
Zero!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.500
I am terribly sorry.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:10.150
The plan failed, again?

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:12.020
Well, never mind.

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:13.440
We still have chances.

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:17.380
The next one is about to be completed.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.130
It's time to publicize the outcome of the research.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.340
We made it in time...

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:37.570
We are back!

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:46.480
Just like chipmunks that wake up from hibernation.

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:48.960
How about Himeji-san?

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.110
Don't worry.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:51.830
She will wake up soon.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.180
It's a bit... salty.

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:27.860
Himeji.

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.150
This is no can-kicking.

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:33.960
What are you doing?

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:35.870
Please come and look for us.

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:40.700
Himawari found! Azami found!

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:44.880
Yusura and Momota found! Shikimi found!

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:52.550
It's true.

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.740
Defense is important.

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:23.890
It's far away but very close  .

00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:27.860
It's cold but warm at the same time  .

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:55.850
My extended palms will call for the dream  .

00:23:55.550 --> 00:24:00.190
I will continue walking ahead  .

00:24:11.320 --> 00:24:11.890
Huh?

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:15.010
The collapsed person there is... Komurasaki-kun!

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.390
Get a hold of yourself!

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:21.010
The boy students are all trapped in the enemy's hideout.

00:24:21.010 --> 00:24:21.910
Good.

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:25.560
Let's sneak into their hideout.

00:24:26.950 --> 00:24:29.120
Azami-chan is going in alone?

00:24:29.120 --> 00:24:30.300
It's dangerous!

00:24:30.300 --> 00:24:33.040
And what's with that case?

00:24:33.040 --> 00:24:36.530
Next time: "The kunoichi spy's great strategy."

00:24:36.530 --> 00:24:38.840
Hayato-dono, why are you here?
